WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.850
In your textbook, a photo of a
cell is five centimetres across.

2
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.650
Under the photo, it says:
magnified two thousand times.

3
00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.310
The real cell is far too
small to see with your eyes.

4
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.770
So how big is it really?

5
00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:19.150
In this mission, you'll meet
the magnification equation,

6
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.730
which links image size, real
size and magnification.

7
00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:25.850
You'll rearrange it to find
whichever one you need.

8
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:30.110
And you'll convert between
millimetres and micrometres,

9
00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.750
the tiny unit used for cells.

10
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:37.130
Your mission: work out the real
size of the cell in the photo.
